      "source": "theorem _root_.CompressionEval.fresh_sets_logic_07 {α β γ : Type*} (f : α → β) (g : β → γ) (hf : Function.Surjective f) (hg : Function.Surjective g) :\n  ∀ z, ∃ x, g (f x)=z ∧ f x ∈ Set.range f :=\nby intro z; obtain ⟨y, hy⟩ := hg z; obtain ⟨x, hx⟩ := hf y; exact ⟨x, by simpa [hx] using hy, ⟨x,rfl⟩⟩",
